  Slug: quick-refugee
  DisplayName: Quick Refugee
  IconPath: systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/background.svg
  Description: The living residents of Geb are known as the quick, and it is not,
    overall, a very pleasant thing to be. While some of the quick choose to make
    the best of their lot, or even thrive in Geb's undead-dominated society, you
    decided that whatever terrors the outside world holds, they pale in comparison
    to those that make up the Gebbite upper class. And considering that escape means
    braving the Mana Wastes, you must have been very, very certain indeed. Choose
    two attribute boosts. One must be to Dexterity or Wisdom , and one is a free
    attribute boost. You're trained in Stealth and Undead Lore. When you Hide or
    @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Sneak] successfully, you are also @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Hidden]
    or @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Concealed] from undeads' lifesense
    and other special precise senses the undead possess.
  SourceTitle: Pathfinder Wake the Dead #2
